{"host":"labuser@lab-vm-2204","current_version":"22.04","target_version":"24.04","summary":"The upgrade from Ubuntu 22.04 to 24.04 will introduce several changes and potential issues, particularly affecting Apache2, PHP, Nginx, OpenSSH, and PostgreSQL.","claims":[{"text":"Apache2 in Ubuntu 24.04 supports mod_md configurations via a local tailscale daemon and uses the pcre2 library for regular expression evaluation.","category":"package","affected_package":"apache2","chunk_ids":["24.04_apache2_1"],"support_score":0.719,"sources":[{"chunk_id":"24.04_apache2_1","url":"https://documentation.ubuntu.com/release-notes/24.04/","scraped_at":"2026-07-06T09:59:33.921124"}],"flags":[]},{"text":"The PHP package in Ubuntu 24.04 now automatically restarts the Apache2 service after an upgrade, unlike previous versions.","category":"package","affected_package":"php","chunk_ids":["24.04_php_1"],"support_score":0.598,"sources":[{"chunk_id":"24.04_php_1","url":"https://documentation.ubuntu.com/release-notes/24.04/","scraped_at":"2026-07-06T09:59:33.921124"}],"flags":[]},{"text":"Nginx in Ubuntu 24.04 has been updated to version 1.24, which includes support for OpenSSL 3.0 and TLSv1.3 by default.","category":"package","affected_package":"nginx","chunk_ids":["24.04_nginx_0"],"support_score":0.872,"sources":[{"chunk_id":"24.04_nginx_0","url":"https://documentation.ubuntu.com/release-notes/24.04/","scraped_at":"2026-07-06T09:59:33.921124"}],"flags":[]},{"text":"OpenSSH in Ubuntu 24.04 uses systemd socket activation by default, with settings from /etc/ssh/sshd_config read by a systemd generator.","category":"package","affected_package":"openssh-server","chunk_ids":["24.04_openssh_0"],"support_score":0.945,"sources":[{"chunk_id":"24.04_openssh_0","url":"https://documentation.ubuntu.com/release-notes/24.04/","scraped_at":"2026-07-06T09:59:33.921124"}],"flags":[]},{"text":"Ubuntu 24.04 includes the new 6.8 Linux kernel, which brings many new features and bug fixes.","category":"general","affec